    <description>09.10.25: SS-11030 - Auto-close, auto-response in Korean Language for Korean Support Models
09.09.25: SS-11344 - Update Last Response Date field after sending of email.
08.14.24: SS-8784 - Revise initial start of countdown.
08.14.24: SS-8711 - Set Resolution code to non-responsive customer when a case is auto closed.
Nightly run that reminds customers of stale cases at day3, day6, &amp; day 9. Then closes case after day9 reminder.
08.14.24: SS-8711 - Set Resolution code to non-responsive customer when a case is auto closed.
11.07.24:   SS-8831 - senderAddress moved to constant variable</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>formula_IsSupportModelKorea</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>IF(CONTAINS({!$Record.Support_Model__c},&quot;Korea&quot;),TRUE,FALSE)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>Formula_LastCustomerResponseDate</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>TODAY()-DATEVALUE({!$Record.Last_Customer_Response_Date__c})</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>formula_LastResponseDate_count</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>TODAY()-DATEVALUE({!$Record.Last_Response_Date__c})</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
