    <textTemplates>
        <name>CaseFeedUpdate</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>false</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>&lt;p&gt;Automated email reminder sent to customer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Case hasn&apos;t been updated since {!$Record.Last_Customer_Response_Date__c}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&apos;ll close the Case at 9 days after Last Customer Response Date if there&apos;s no further interaction.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</text>
    </textTemplates>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>day12texttemplate</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>Hello {!$Record.Contact.FirstName},
We are reaching out regarding your Tanium Support Case #{!$Record.CaseNumber} - {!$Record.Subject}.
We have not heard from you since {!$Record.Last_Customer_Response_Date__c} and this case will be closed today as we can take no further action at this time.
Should you still need assistance after the case is closed you have seven days to reply and reopen the case. After the seven days the case will permanently close and a new case will need to be opened.
Kindest regards,
Tanium Support</text>
    </textTemplates>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>days4and8texttemplate</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>Hello {!$Record.Contact.FirstName},
We are reaching out regarding your Tanium Support Case {!$Record.CaseNumber} – {!$Record.Subject}.
We have not heard from you since {!$Record.Last_Customer_Response_Date__c}. Please login to help.tanium.com and open the Tanium Support Portal to review the case thread and reply accordingly or if the issue no longer persists let us know and we will resolve the case.
If we don’t hear from you soon this case will automatically be closed as we can take no further action on it. Should you still need assistance after the case is closed you have seven (7) days to reply and reopen the case. After the seven (7) days the case will permanently close and a new case will need to be opened.
Thank you for your prompt attention to this case.
Kindest regards,
Tanium Support</text>
    </textTemplates>
